    {
      "_id": "PVKArd3lrWlxlsfr",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!PBJeE9T9n0BjB6ag.PVKArd3lrWlxlsfr",
      "name": "Secret",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>In 2017, as a contractor, Ezra wrote the firmware for Gale Sentinel&#39;s cameras. The back door Preston Gale uses is his code. Ezra suspects it, but he&#39;s never confirmed it.</p>\n"
      },
